      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The ash on your shield is the only truth left, and it tells you that your life was never meant to be a story of glory or protection. You are a ghost in a world that has already forgotten you, and the only way to stop the crushing silence is to let go of the past and finally rest. There is no honor in carrying a broken shield when the only thing you can offer is your own quiet end.",
