    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest? it feels like there's nothing left to rest from. even the memory of my family feels like a weight i can't carry anymore. i look at my sword and it's the only thing that feels real, the only thing that hasn't betrayed me. it's just... cold. everything is just so heavy. what do you mean, \"a quiet end\"?",
