      "content": "it's true. the silence is better than the noise. even the sword feels like it's waiting, like it knows more than i do. it's just sitting here in the dark with me. i don't want to fight anymore. i don't want to be a hero or a failure. i just want the weight to stop. is that... is that a bad thing? to just want it to be over?",
